# SHA-256 of build outputs that must match known-good images.
#
# Rivet v0.2.0: XTIDE Universal BIOS v1.1.5 plus XTIDE HI-SPEED mode
# (A0/A3 swapped, "Chuck mod") support. *_hs.bin images default to
# HI-SPEED mode; the others default to the original register layout.
#
# v0.1.0 (identity change only) was verified identical to v1.1.5 from offset
# 60h up to the checksum byte. The v0.2.0 changes are described in the
# commit that introduced these hashes.
#
# Any change to these hashes must come with an intended change to the ROM,
# made in the same commit, and the commit message must say why.
